				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 2, 11, 16</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Syrio madefactus tempora nardo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					3, 6, 63</span></i>
			.</div>
